From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since35 fw areas + stock 0x45 prefix + 0x40

since34: 0x45 SPI + 0x1b HDL ack work. 0x42 is sent. IC never sends
IDENTIFY 0x10. Firmware does not start.

Stock zeroflash_do_romboot_firmware_download after write_message(0x45)==0
is immediately switch_mode(BOOTLOADER)=0x42. F35 / 0x2F / 0x30 are other
paths (TYPE_F35 or need_* bits). TD4150 RomBoot stays on 0x45.

td4150_a12s_boe.bin 147456: ROMBOOT_APP_CODE 97280, APP_CONFIG 4096,
DISPLAY 2048, BOOT_CONFIG 256. Stock 0x45 is APP_CODE + 14 reserved
([0]=size>>16, [1..13]=0), not a 4-byte LE length. Configs only on
0x1b need_*. Stock probe identify(false) in RomBoot sends 0x40 after
0x45+0x42. Stock does not wait for FB / gpio_lcd_rst.

since35:
- Parse/log every fw area at probe (id, name, offset, size, crc32).
- Fix stock idx reuse in APP_CONFIG img_version copy that skipped
  DISPLAY/BOOT_CONFIG. 0x45 ROMBOOT_APP_CODE was already filled.
- Confirm 0x45 payload is stock 14-byte prefix + APP_CODE; log crc
  and first bytes. After 0x45 log 0x1b bits once.
- After 0x42 still RomBoot: one GET_ROMBOOT_INFO 0x40 (disable_irq
  if gpio=0), log payload. 0x1b may complete that waiter to log.
- Keep 0x45 -> 0x42 -> wait IDENTIFY. No 0x14, no retry 97k, no
  ENABLE_REPORT, no do_polling, no touch_init in 0x04, no lcd_rst.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-identify-after-42.patch.

